            <!--FHIRPath expressions with .ofType(...) are poorly supported at the moment, so it was rewritten. Original expression: 'Bundle.entry.first().resource.ofType(Composition).section.where(code.coding.where(system = 'http://loinc.org' and code = '47519-4').exists()).all(entry.empty() and emptyReason.exists() and text.div.exists())'-->
